  "description": "Contains all scientific studies contained within the USGS ScienceBase data catalog. Each feature's geospatial coordinates represents the spatial extent of the scientific study.\n\nMore info can be found at https://www.sciencebase.gov/catalog/\n\nAll features in this dataset derive from the 'usgs:sciencebase' sitemap in Geoconnex.\n\nThe source code that generated the RDF data which was transformed into this asset can be found at https://github.com/internetofwater/sciencebase_bulk_rdf\n\nMainstem association was disabled for this dataset so features will not have an associated Geoconnex mainstem.",
